    for certain expenses incurred in this offering. See &ldquo;Underwriting&rdquo; on page S-38 of this prospectus supplement for more
    information regarding the underwriting compensation.</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(2) </FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Assumes the underwriter
    does not exercise its over-allotment option.</FONT></TD></TR>
