    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Disinfection Robots (S
    - Series) for indoor applications.</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-indent: 0in; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

