    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">directly to investors, including through privately negotiated transactions,
    a specific bidding, auction or other process;</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

