    Obligations</B></FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; width: 0%">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; width: 10%; border-bottom: black 1.5pt solid; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><B>Per
    <BR>
    delivery /<BR>
    order</B></FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; width: 0%; padding-bottom: 1.5pt">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; border-bottom: black 1.5pt solid; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><B>Per<BR>
    month</B></FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="background-color: #CCEEFF">
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: top"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Cash-In-Transit (CIT) &ndash; Non Dedicated Vehicles (Non-DV)</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">(a)</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Delivery from point A to point B per customer request.&nbsp;&nbsp;Service
    obligation is generally completed within same day.</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&#8730;</FONT></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="background-color: white">
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: top"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Cash-In-Transit (CIT) &ndash; Dedicated Vehicles to Banks (DV)</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">(a)</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Delivery from point A to point B per customer request.&nbsp;&nbsp;Service
    obligation is generally completed within same day.</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&#8730;</FONT></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="background-color: #CCEEFF">
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: top"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">ATM Management</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">(a)</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Includes replenishment of ATM machines and first level maintenance
